⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
293 calories 36g protein (for the entire pint, mix-ins/toppings included)

Minter Wonderland Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Full recipe book (165+ flavors) in bio!

- 1 Chocolate Protein Shake (350-400ml)  
- 20-25g Monk Fruit sweetener
- 20g black cocoa powder
- ⅛ tsp peppermint extract
- A pinch of salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Mix-ins/toppings:
- 3 Oreo Thins (cream removed)
- 10g mini lucky-charms-style marshmallows (I used the ones from @jetpuffed)
293 cal 30g C, 7g F, 36g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run your pint under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting if very powdery
5. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with the Oreos and half of the marshmallows
6. Run the “Mix-in” cycle
7. Top with the rest of the marshmallows

